MarketLens is an interactive prediction market analytics dashboard that uses live Kalshi market data to help users explore probabilities, recent price movement, volume, historical trends.

Festures include:
Live prediction market data from Kalshi
Interactive Market Map
Implied probability
Trading volume
Market detail pages
Historical probability charts
Volume and order book data
Biggest Movers section
Gemini AI Market Briefs

The frontend is on GitHub Pages with a Flask backend hosted on Render. The backend retrieves live Kalshi data and does the numerical analysis used throughout the site.

The AI Market Brief feature uses Gemini only to explain already calculated market statistics.
